<title>FRANCE: Highlights of ONIC soft wheat estimates.</title>
<headline>Highlights of ONIC soft wheat estimates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cereals office ONIC's monthly</p>
<p>soft wheat estimates (July/June, million tonnes).</p>
<p>			96/97(Mar)  96/97(Feb)	     95/96</p>
<p> Opening stocks	 2.212	 2.212		3.087</p>
<p> Harvested crop	34.578	34.616	     29.825</p>
<p> Delivered crop	30.420	30.470	     25.955</p>
<p> Non-farm use	  12.779	12.880	     12.367</p>
<p> Exports to EU	  9.135	 9.035		8.613</p>
<p> Export to non-EU     6.400	 6.250		3.750</p>
<p> Non-EU flour export  2.000	 2.000		1.803</p>
<p> Final stock	    2.061	 2.185		2.212</p>
</text>
